This is an application using Hibernate ORM, with scripts to generate profiling data for AOT builds. The applications is based on https://git.spacefox.fr/spacefox/perftests-quarkus, thus its name. It is a very specific application: a lot of very small entities, one entity per package... So take it with a grain of salt. It can still provide some interesting insights about the Hibernate ORM bootstrap with AOT. The application is large, so building it and profiling it takes time, be patient.
